The '''2025–26 First Division League''' (known as the '''[[Yelo Saudi Arabia|Yelo]] League''' for sponsorship reasons) was the fifth season of the [[Saudi First Division League]] after its rebrand, and the 69th season of the Saudi First Division since its establishment in 1957. The season began on 11 September 2025 and concluded with the play-off finals on 23 May 2026.<ref>{{cite web |title=روزنامة الموسم الرياضي 2025-2026 |url=https://x.com/FDL_KSA/status/1929206306688192565}}</ref>

==Overview==
===Changes===
On 29 May 2024, the [[Saudi Arabian Football Federation|SAFF]] announced that foreign goalkeepers would not be allowed to play in the First Division League starting from the 2025–26 season.<ref>{{cite web |title=منع الحراس الأجانب في «يلو» |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/841252}}</ref>

===Team changes===
The following teams have changed division since the 2024–25 season.
